<title>USA: Morrison Knudsen names Cleberg CFO.</title>
<headline>Morrison Knudsen names Cleberg CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Knudsen Corp Tuesday named A.S. Cleberg to the post of chief financial officer, effective May 5.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Cleberg, formerly from Honeywell Inc will be responsible for management of the company's accounting, finance and tax functions.</p>
<p>He replaces Denis Slavich, who resigned last year.</p>
